I'll help you make the species selection list scrollable and searchable. This requires converting the dropdown to a more advanced select component. Here's the minimal change to achieve this:

Step 1: Add this CSS to your styles.css file (add at the end):

```css
/* Enhanced species selector with search */
.selector-group {
    position: relative;
}

.species-select-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 320px;
}

#speciesSelect {
    width: 100%;
    cursor: pointer;
    appearance: none;
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='16' height='16' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='%23333' stroke-width='2' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><polyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'/></svg>");
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: right 15px center;
    background-size: 16px;
    padding-right: 45px;
}

.species-dropdown {
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: white;
    border: 3px solid #fdcd5a;
    border-radius: 24px;
    margin-top: 5px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    z-index: 1000;
    display: none;
    max-height: 350px;
    overflow-y: auto;
}

.species-dropdown.show {
    display: block;
    animation: slideDown 0.2s ease;
}

.species-search {
    padding: 12px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 24px 24px 0 0;
}

.species-search input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border: 2px solid #a5b77a;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    outline: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.species-search input:focus {
    border-color: #479e47;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #c6ec9e;
    transform: scale(1.02);
}

.species-options {
    max-height: 250px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 8px 0;
}

.species-option {
    padding: 10px 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    font-style: italic;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
}

.species-option:hover {
    background: #e8f0da;
    transform: translateX(5px);
}

.species-option.selected {
    background: #1a5830;
    color: white;
}

.species-option.highlighted {
    background: #f5c542;
    color: #1a5830;
}

.no-results {
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: #666;
    font-style: italic;
}
```

