That's it! This creates a searchable, scrollable dropdown for your species list while maintaining all existing functionality. The dropdown includes:

· 🔍 Search as you type
· 📜 Scrollable list (supports hundreds of species)
· ⌨️ Keyboard navigation (arrow keys + Enter)
· 🖱️ Click to select
· 🎯 Same look and feel as your app

